00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:18,039
I don't want to keep thinking about it, but

282
00:16:18,039 --> 00:16:19,959
you basically just think of all the properties

283
00:16:19,959 --> 00:16:25,319
that should hold and then you execute the generator.

284
00:16:25,319 --> 00:16:28,079
That's called property testing or property-based testing.

285
00:16:28,079 --> 00:16:29,279
I love property-based testing.

286
00:16:29,279 --> 00:16:31,000
It's really awesome.

287
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,600
But there's something better.

